 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the table below for problems 4 and 5:</p>\n<blockquote>\nTyler needs to complete this table for his consumer science class. He knows that 1 tablespoon contains 3 teaspoons and that 1 cup contains 16 tablespoons.\n</blockquote>\n<table class=\"unnumbered os-raise-midsizetable\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">\n<p>Number of <br>\n                Teaspoons</p>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">\n<p>Number of <br>\n                Tablespoons</p>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">\n<p>Number of <br>\n                Cups</p>\n</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>a. ____\n            </td>\n<td>b. ____\n            </td>\n<td>\n<p>2</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>36</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>12</p>\n</td>\n<td>c. ____\n            </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>d. ____\n            </td>\n<td>\n<p>48</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>3</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
